            "description": {
              "content": "Reporting API requests require a combination of assigned Bridge user name, Bridge password, and a successfully generated authentication token. The Bridge credentials used are assigned separately from the Purchase and Sales API credentials. The received token for Reporting is valid for 60 minutes from issuance and may be used for all requests during its lifespan. Note: This endpoint is only valid in the Production environment.",
